  {
   "id": "n16",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## How to read this vault\n\n- **Neurons - Rush Hour** - every unit coloured by what it actually did\n- **Neurons - Quiet Night** - the same units on a near-empty road\n- **Timeline/** - one canvas per hour: watch the memory build up\n- **Neurons/** - one note per unit, with its own trace\n\nEvery number here was replayed from the trained weights.",
